    {skills.map((group) => <div><h3>{group.title}</h3><ul>{group.items.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div>)}
  </div>
  <p class="skills-note">My main stack is .NET. These are tools I’ve used across backend, cloud, and infrastructure work; I’m continuing to develop my experience with them.</p>
</section>
